flowchart LR
    User[普通用户]
    subgraph Platform[LumaLife 平台 / UC03]
        Cart((购物车))
        Order((创建外卖订单))
    end
    User --> Cart --> Order
    Order --> Pending[待支付订单]
    Pending -->|首次支付| Pay[模拟支付]
    Pay -->|成功| Paid[PAID]
    Pending -->|用户取消| Cancelled[CANCELLED]
    Paid --> Tracking[订单状态时间线]
    Cancelled --> Tracking
    Paid -->|取消请求| Reject[拒绝取消，状态不变]
    Order -.地址快照、按商家拆单.-> Tracking
    Pay -.clientRequestId 幂等.-> Tracking
    Tracking --> User
